Module Header Config Task <code>sched/syn_task.h</code> <code>SYN_USE_SCHED</code> Scheduler <code>sched/syn_sched.h</code> <code>SYN_USE_SCHED</code> <p>The scheduler manages a caller-owned array of <code>SYN_Task</code> descriptors. Each call to <code>syn_sched_run()</code> selects and runs the single highest-priority ready task (0 = highest priority), with per-priority round-robin among equal-priority tasks.</p> <pre><code>static SYN_Task tasks[3];
static SYN_Sched sched;

syn_task_create(&amp;tasks[0], "blink",   blink_fn,   1, NULL);
syn_task_create(&amp;tasks[1], "serial",  serial_fn,  0, NULL);
syn_task_create(&amp;tasks[2], "monitor", monitor_fn, 2, NULL);

syn_sched_init(&amp;sched, tasks, 3);
syn_sched_run_forever(&amp;sched);  // never returns
</code></pre>
